			title: "The Ocean's Metal"
			x: 8.25d
			y: 1.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: ["&3Neptune's Bounty chests have a chance of carrying Neptunium, a powerful metal with the power of the sea. Well, they also could carry equipment MADE of Neptunium as well."]
